# Tailwind CSS

Always use Tailwind CSS. Do not add raw visual CSS or non-Tailwind custom classes.

## CSS files

- Set visual styles with Tailwind utilities via `@apply`. Never write raw properties such as `display`, `margin`, `padding`, `color`, `position`, or `width`.
- Use native CSS nesting for child selectors and pseudo-elements (`svg { }`, `&::before`, `&:hover`). Do not use SCSS parent concatenation (`&--modifier`); write BEM modifier classes as full selectors.
- Use Tailwind breakpoints (`md:` inside `@apply`, or `@variant md`). Do not use raw `@media`.
- Allowed without `@apply`: custom properties (`--foo`), plus `@import`, `@theme`, and `@layer`.

### Tailwind v4 syntax

- Use bare values instead of unnecessary brackets: `z-45`, not `z-[45]`.
- Reference CSS variables with parentheses: `left-(--railx)`, not `left-[var(--railx)]`. Use a type hint when ambiguous: `border-(length:--dot-border)`.
- In `@apply` calc values, do not encode spaces as underscores. Write `top-[calc((var(--a)-var(--b))/2)]`, not `top-[calc((var(--a)_-_var(--b))/2)]`. Underscores are only for HTML class attributes when a space is required.
- Place `!important` as a suffix: `mt-0!`, not `!mt-0`. Same in HTML classes and `@apply` (e.g. `lg:mt-0!`).

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.scroll-line-pin {
    pointer-events: none;
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 45;
}
.scroll-line-pin svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
}
.scroll-line-pin--footer {
    z-index: 20;
}

/* ✅ GOOD */
.scroll-line-pin {
    @apply pointer-events-none absolute z-45 left-(--railx)
        top-[calc((var(--f-header-height)-var(--scroll-line-pin-height))/2)];

    svg {
        @apply block size-full;
    }
}

.scroll-line-pin--footer {
    @apply z-20;
}
```

## PHP/HTML templates

- Use Tailwind utility classes for layout and appearance.
- Component classes (`scroll-line`, `btn`) are allowed only when they are defined with `@apply` in CSS.
- Do not use inline `style` for visual CSS properties. CSS custom properties in `style` are allowed when needed (e.g. `--cl-headline-before`).

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<div style="display: flex; margin-top: 2rem;"></div>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<div class="flex mt-8"></div>
<div class="scroll-line"></div>
```
